# SECURITY: credential material must never be committed.
# Six Firebase service-account private keys were previously committed under
# public/firebase/ and remain in this repository's history. These patterns stop
# that class of file from being reintroduced.
/public/firebase
/storage/app/firebase
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*service-account*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
